[[2047,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/3238649\">7010C44</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238681\">7010E38</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238680\">7010E34</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238675\">7010D38</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238679\">7010E22</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238519\">5570T96</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238678\">7010E11</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238633\">7010A04</a></p><p>1. Disconnect the electrical wire retainer from the bracket.</p><p>2. Undo the bolts (2a) and the nut (2b) securing the bracket.</p><p>3. Remove the bracket.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2019048.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2047,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Check that the reinforcement\nbracket is not damaged.</p><p>Fit the reinforcement bracket and secure\nusing the bolts and the nut.</p><p>Check the electrical wire retainer.</p><p><a href=\"#/3238633\">7010A04</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238678\">7010E11</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238519\">5570T96</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238679\">7010E22</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238675\">7010D38</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238680\">7010E34</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238681\">7010E38</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238649\">7010C44</a></p>"]]